{
  "about": "Real-chat bot e2e (docs/testing/bot-e2e.md). Each step: what to do in the chat app, the regexes the bot replies must match (each one by some reply), and the server state afterwards (cumulative, as source:amount multisets). {{code}} is a fresh code from `bot-e2e.mjs code`; {{total}} is the true total of the receipt photo passed with --photo (receipts below: the real MC-OCR receipts of server/test/fixtures/receipts/, totals as in server/test/kie.contract.test.js).",
